  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi Innovative Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pilot in Malawi seeks to improve foundational literacy and numeracy outcomes for primary school learners by integrating evidence-based remedial teaching practices. This initiative aligns with Malawi&#x2019;s National Reading and Numeracy Programs (NRP/NNP) and focuses on institutional sustainability and scalability. The proposed remediation pilot also fits with FCDO priorities by addressing foundational learning challenges, supporting sustainable and scalable national systems, and promoting inclusive and equitable education outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
